# Execution path

Admitted immutable binding -> mc.mission_run.v1 root -> StageGraph or GoalDirected
family -> mc.operation.v1 operation -> operation.execute -> bounded Deep Agents
-> immutable journal/effect/settlement -> family reconciliation.

Domain interpreters propose; application reducers authorize and terminalize.
Temporal owns deterministic mechanics. Checkpoints and traces remain evidence.

Read scoped source AGENTS.md and docs/knowledge/execution.md. Family changes must
preserve scope/run/ERC/type/epoch identity, operation budget/settlement and linked
parent boundaries. Actual workflow registration, activity registration and queue
binding must agree. Test real histories/replay for execution claims.

Do not restore old app/ paths, domain-specific engines or Mongo repositories.
Retained historical work-package docs are provenance, not current instructions.
